Subject: Use local repository fixtures in Resolver smoke tests

The Resolver supplier tests create their own sessions and contact Maven
Central even during an offline Maven build. Use the repository fixtures
already shipped in the source archive for version range resolution and
dependency collection. Ignore repositories declared by artifact descriptors
so the test fixtures cannot reintroduce Central transitively.

Upstream-Status: Not submitted

